@Operative.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5253
@token = paste-access-token-here

### Public health check
GET {{Operative.Api_HostAddress}}/health

### Public service information
GET {{Operative.Api_HostAddress}}/api/info

### Current user without a token (expect 401)
GET {{Operative.Api_HostAddress}}/api/me
Accept: application/json

### Current user with a JWT from UserAccess.Api
GET {{Operative.Api_HostAddress}}/api/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

###
